            "action_name": {
              "value": "Steal Shadow"
            },
            "action_description": {
              "value": "(divine, necromancy)\n\nRequirements: The shadow hit a living creature with a shadow hand Strike on its previous action\n\nThe shadow pulls at the target's shadow, making the creature enfeebled 2 (or enfeebled 3 on a critical hit). This is cumulative with other enfeebled conditions from shadows, to a maximum of enfeebled 4. If this increases a creature's enfeebled value to 3 or more, the target's shadow is separated from its body (see shadow spawn). Enfeebled from Steal Shadow decreases by 1 every hour."
            },
